career-ops HK overlay
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

This tree is a Hong Kong / APAC overlay for career-ops. It helps other people
run that system against Hong Kong boards, with extra gates so nothing is
submitted until the operator says so. It is not a personal fork dump and it
is not an official career-ops product.

